## Appendix B: Human-in-the-Loop Gate 3 Control
Pipeline execution state shall transition to Paused before production-adjacent release signoff. Resume is permitted only after manual validation evidence confirms: gateway-only routing, scanner-before-storage sequence, authorized bucket destination, successful CDN invalidation, and 2.0-second SLA compliance.
